  "changes": [
    "Support inbox counters now belong to the existing AccountChatCounterService, separate from event/feed counters. Administrator selection, per-workspace batching, stored paths and update order are preserved. The existing HTTP routes/credentials/scopes delegate to the new narrow SupportCaseCounters owner.",
    "ProfileMenuCountersService reads the existing selected-profile/account counter snapshot. Shared DTO mapping moved unchanged to AccountCounterMapper. CommunityProfileCounters retains the prior community calculation; ProfileReadStateService calls the existing installed cache owners synchronously. No model, counter predicate, selection rule, extra query or network hop.",
    "NotificationOutboxService consumes optional WorkspaceNames. Native/remote GroupDirectory supplies the existing name lookup through that contract, preserving absent versus present-null labels and owner failures. Account recipient IDs, workspace ID, notification URL and delivery behavior stay unchanged.",
    "The existing native profile-selection check now also reads chat header counters with the correct and a forged requested profile ID."
  ],
